            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">This notebook computes the natural frequencies and modal shapes (normal modes)\nof an <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(N||)</marimo-tex> degree of freedom system. </span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Please note that changing the number of degrees of freedom will reset the whole computation and\nerase the entries in the matrices below!</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-ui-element object-id='vblA-0' random-id='063a4cbd-be1b-782e-67e0-cfff526be1f0'><marimo-number data-initial-value='2' data-label='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eNumber of degrees of freedom: &#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-start='2' data-stop='8' data-step='1' data-debounce='false' data-full-width='false' data-disabled='false'></marimo-number></marimo-ui-element></span></span>"
