          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<marimo-ui-element object-id='SFPL-32' random-id='2d3bc943-892a-d57a-3e62-be521cf8b873'><marimo-form data-initial-value='null' data-label='null' data-element-id='&quot;SFPL-31&quot;' data-loading='false' data-bordered='true' data-submit-button-label='&quot;Submit&quot;' data-submit-button-disabled='false' data-clear-on-submit='false' data-show-clear-button='false' data-clear-button-label='&quot;Clear&quot;' data-should-validate='false'><marimo-ui-element object-id='SFPL-31' random-id='95c84afe-b91c-8752-2450-4f51a677e0a0'><marimo-dict data-initial-value='{&quot;mass&quot;:{&quot;i11&quot;:0.0,&quot;i21&quot;:0.0,&quot;i22&quot;:0.0},&quot;stif&quot;:{&quot;i11&quot;:0.0,&quot;i21&quot;:0.0,&quot;i22&quot;:0.0}}' data-label='null' data-element-ids='{&quot;SFPL-26&quot;:&quot;mass&quot;,&quot;SFPL-30&quot;:&quot;stif&quot;}'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Please enter mass and stiffness matrices. </span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Enter only the lower triangular factor, the upper factor will be filled in using symmetry.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Use dots or commas for decimal numbers according to your operating system configuration!</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-ui-element object-id='SFPL-26' random-id='947259a7-fac6-8f92-5548-56c2b0840c0f'><marimo-dict data-initial-value='{&quot;i11&quot;:0.0,&quot;i21&quot;:0.0,&quot;i22&quot;:0.0}' data-label='null' data-element-ids='{&quot;SFPL-23&quot;:&quot;i11&quot;,&quot;SFPL-24&quot;:&quot;i21&quot;,&quot;SFPL-25&quot;:&quot;i22&quot;}'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong><em>Mass matrix</em></strong>:</span> <div class=\"container\"> 1: <div class=\"inline-box\"> <marimo-ui-element object-id='SFPL-23' random-id='888dd9c5-6578-297f-5847-b8975fb0de3e'><marimo-number data-initial-value='0.0' data-label='null' data-debounce='false' data-full-width='true' data-disabled='false'></marimo-number></marimo-ui-element> </div> </div> <div class=\"container\"> 2: <div class=\"inline-box\"> <marimo-ui-element object-id='SFPL-24' random-id='cc5e926e-8f85-9da0-f319-8a7da5d89cdb'><marimo-number data-initial-value='0.0' data-label='null' data-debounce='false' data-full-width='true' data-disabled='false'></marimo-number></marimo-ui-element> </div> <div class=\"inline-box\"> <marimo-ui-element object-id='SFPL-25' random-id='70e93506-4ae9-a48c-0391-4534b0f26b7c'><marimo-number data-initial-value='0.0' data-label='null' data-debounce='false' data-full-width='true' data-disabled='false'></marimo-number></marimo-ui-element> </div> </div></span></marimo-dict></marimo-ui-element></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><marimo-ui-element object-id='SFPL-30' random-id='24ebc335-dfbc-3cbd-b3d9-2fd12428a30a'><marimo-dict data-initial-value='{&quot;i11&quot;:0.0,&quot;i21&quot;:0.0,&quot;i22&quot;:0.0}' data-label='null' data-element-ids='{&quot;SFPL-27&quot;:&quot;i11&quot;,&quot;SFPL-28&quot;:&quot;i21&quot;,&quot;SFPL-29&quot;:&quot;i22&quot;}'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong><em>Stiffness matrix</em></strong>:</span> <div class=\"container\"> 1: <div class=\"inline-box\"> <marimo-ui-element object-id='SFPL-27' random-id='7f4ad075-feff-63bf-8bba-084188c85dac'><marimo-number data-initial-value='0.0' data-label='null' data-debounce='false' data-full-width='true' data-disabled='false'></marimo-number></marimo-ui-element> </div> </div> <div class=\"container\"> 2: <div class=\"inline-box\"> <marimo-ui-element object-id='SFPL-28' random-id='9acde964-4d17-65db-fbef-508d1371bf3a'><marimo-number data-initial-value='0.0' data-label='null' data-debounce='false' data-full-width='true' data-disabled='false'></marimo-number></marimo-ui-element> </div> <div class=\"inline-box\"> <marimo-ui-element object-id='SFPL-29' random-id='7f69282d-9ed6-f598-c80f-93a46de8b994'><marimo-number data-initial-value='0.0' data-label='null