          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"graphical-representation\">Graphical representation</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Please understand that these shapes are drawn only to for a quick visual assessment of the relative magnitudes. These values may represent displacements, rotations or other degrees of freedom, and most likely aren't even in the same direction.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Most likely than not, this <strong>does not</strong> represent the actual shape of the vibration system.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Remember also that the absolute magnitudes don't mean anything, any multiple of a mode shape is also a mode shape.d</span></span>"
          }
